==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Clown Base (Enemy Base)|Clown Base]].
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

